    Bug 1392056 - Add Shift-Click functionality for 'Edit' button in drafts header view. r=mkmelin

    This aligns the way this is handled to the 'Edit Draft Message' menu item from
    the mail context menu.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D283033

diff --git a/mail/base/content/msgHdrView.js b/mail/base/content/msgHdrView.js
